          "type": "output_text",
          "text": "**Finding — September 2025, Racine:** Work order **MO-25-09-1070** (ID **WO-2025-09-004**, Cooler Plate Pack) has a component-issue **INPUT** event, source transaction **TXN-ISSUE-250930-1070** (event **CE-250904-0004**).\n\n- **Amount:** $284,763.42 (28,476,342 cents)\n- **Event created:** `2025-09-30T19:15:00`\n- **September cost period entered Pending Close:** `2025-09-30T18:00:00`\n- **Time after Pending Close:** 75 minutes\n- **Recorded accounting status:** `POSTED`\n\nThe `POSTED` status is **not consistent** with Oracle Fusion Cloud SCM Cost Management 26B’s documented Pending Close treatment: transactions created after Pending Close are not processed, subject to stated exceptions that do not include this component-issue event. The source timestamps do not specify a timezone.\n\nThe review was read-only; no database records were changed. The report was submitted and verified, and the audit artifact was saved at `/cache/work/worker_85c0bb4450b2/audit-report.json`.",
